WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Coding agents guess at your design system.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Hex colors, made-up components, wrong props. It looks fine; it isn’t your system.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.600
Here the agent asks Atlas to check a screen.

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:21.000
validate_screen finds 4 issues, each with a line, a rule and a fix.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The agent looks up the real components instead of guessing.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
It fixes each line: a public import, Card, a defined component, a real variant.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Then it checks again: 0 issues.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The agent can run this check on every screen, before you review it.

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Measured on 20 prompts × 3 runs: valid screens with the Atlas lookups vs without.
